    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov14">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e98">Caput 14</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_1@1-1">Sapiens,</quote>
            etc.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e110">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e112" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_1@9-9">Destruet</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e115"><seg type="qs">male vivendo, <pb ed="#P" n="1097A"/> et aliquando aperte regnando</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">de quibus aperte subdit:</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e126">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e128">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e130">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e132" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_3@1-3">In ore stulti.</quote>
            Quia stulti per vaniloquium humiles, quos despiciunt, affligunt; sed hi per doctrinam sapientium, ne decipiantur, se muniunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e137">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e139">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e141">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e143" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_4@1-2">Ubi non,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e146"><seg type="qs">Haec haerent superioribus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui Sareptanam viduam pascit a qua et ipse pascitur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e155">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e157">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e159">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e161" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_6@1-3">Quaerit derisor sapientiam,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e164"><seg type="qs">Ut Caiphas</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia perverse quaerunt, nunquam prorsus inveniunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e174">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e176">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e178">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e180" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_7@1-2">Vade contra,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e183"><seg type="qs">Ideo derisor sapientiam, quam quaerit, non invenit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ejusque meditationi operam dare satagunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e194">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e196">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1097B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e200" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_10@12-12">Extraneus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e203"><seg type="qs">Id est reprobus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unde subditur: <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e209" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_11@1-2">Dominus impiorum,</quote> etc.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e214">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e216" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_10">Sapiens timet et declinat.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e221"><seg type="qs">Sicut stulti est de sua alacritate confidere</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">aut post mortem fortiter poenas ferat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e230">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e232">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e234">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e236" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_17@1-1">Impatiens,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e239"><seg type="qs">Reprehensibilis quidem est impatiens</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">inter reprobos aestimatur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e248">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e250">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e252">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e254" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_19@1-4">Jacebunt mali ante bonos.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e257"><seg type="qs">Videntes tormenta eorum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ad videnda eorum supplicia.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e266">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e268">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e270">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e272" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_24@5-6">Fatuitas stultorum.</quote>
            Imprudentia, quasi improvidentia dicitur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e277">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e279">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e281">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e283" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_25@1-4">Liberat animas testis fidelis.</quote>
            Catholicus praedicatur, qui testimonia Scripturarum fideliter <pb ed="#P" n="1097C"/> praedicat, et profert; haereticus mendacia.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e289">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e291" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_25@6-7">Profert mendacia.</quote>
            Alia translatio: Incendit autem mendacio animas dolosus deceptor.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e295">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e297" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_25@8-8">Versipellis,</quote>
            id est diabolus, qui mala, quae suggerit, bona mentitur: et dum bona promittit aeterna, ducit ad tormenta.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e303">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e305">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e307">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e309" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_26@1-3">In timore Domini.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e312"><seg type="qs">Timor Domini fiduciam fortitudinis praestat</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">speraverunt in Domino.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e321">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e323">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e325">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e327" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_27@1-2">Timor Domini.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e330"><seg type="qs">Haec est spes eorum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unde, <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e336" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps110_10@1-4">Initium sapientiae timor Domini<!-- check: Migne cites ps9; text matches ps110_10 --></quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov14-Dd1e343">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov14-Hd1e345">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e347">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e349" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_30@1-2">Vita carnium.</quote>
            Per carnem infirma, per ossa firma. Si mentis innocentia custoditur, etsi <pb ed="#P" n="1097D"/> quae foris infirma sunt, quandoque roborantur; unde subdit:
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov14-d1e355">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov14-Qd1e357" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov14_30@5-7">Putredo ossium invidia,</quote>
            quia per livoris vitium ante oculos Dei pereunt ea quae humanis oculis fortia videntur. Ossa enim per invidiam putrescere, est robusta quaeque perire.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
